      "text": "Auto mode is now the default in Claude Code. Starting August 14, new sessions on Pro, Max, and Team plans will run in auto mode. Instead of asking you to approve each command, Claude Code routes every action through a classifier designed to block anything irreversible, destructive, or aimed outside your environment. When the classifier blocks something, Claude usually finds a safer path or asks you.",
